WEBVTT

00:00:19.310 --> 00:00:22.140
Disturbers of the peace of Hinamizawa!

00:00:22.140 --> 00:00:24.710
You will release my Satoko!

00:00:24.710 --> 00:00:26.880
Rika! Don't come any closer!

00:00:28.480 --> 00:00:31.940
Who do you think you are, dimwit?!

00:00:31.940 --> 00:00:37.560
You think a little girl like yourself can defeat us, the Shiten-nou?

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:43.640
Until now you've ruined countless of our evil plans.

00:00:43.960 --> 00:00:49.650
Magical Girl Oyashiro Rika, today is the day we end you!

00:00:55.870 --> 00:00:57.160
Oh no!

00:01:07.230 --> 00:01:08.550
A dream...

00:01:12.490 --> 00:01:16.310
When I grow up... will I become like that?

00:01:16.310 --> 00:01:18.240
Rika! Rika!

00:01:18.240 --> 00:01:19.720
Run away! Please!

00:01:19.720 --> 00:01:21.730
Quickly, quickly!

00:01:24.970 --> 00:01:25.930
Satoko?

00:01:25.930 --> 00:01:27.320
Satoko?!

00:01:32.660 --> 00:01:33.790
Rika?

00:01:34.670 --> 00:01:36.700
You are safe, thank goodness!

00:01:37.340 --> 00:01:39.670
It's all right now.

00:01:41.040 --> 00:01:46.420
Satoko, did you have a dream where I was a magical girl?

00:01:47.470 --> 00:01:48.710
A dream?

00:01:55.150 --> 00:01:59.220
It is the staff you brought back from the Saiguden yesterday...

00:01:59.220 --> 00:02:00.800
...because you had never seen it before.

00:02:00.800 --> 00:02:05.980
That's right, because there shouldn't be a tool in there that I don't recognise.

00:02:06.350 --> 00:02:10.650
This is probably the reason why we had that strange dream.

00:02:10.650 --> 00:02:14.230
But it's strange that we both had the same dream.

00:02:14.960 --> 00:02:17.200
What's going on?

00:02:22.620 --> 00:02:24.810
This is some thick fog.

00:02:24.810 --> 00:02:27.620
This is the first time Hinamizawa has had fog like this.

00:02:27.980 --> 00:02:30.130
Something isn't right...

00:02:30.130 --> 00:02:32.760
Satoko, be careful.

00:02:32.760 --> 00:02:34.500
At last, you've shown up!

00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:36.010
Furude Rika!

00:02:40.090 --> 00:02:42.640
W-Who are you?

00:02:42.640 --> 00:02:43.960
Apparate!

00:02:43.960 --> 00:02:45.180
Saigu Majin!

00:02:45.180 --> 00:02:46.970
Nail Ripper!

00:04:34.870 --> 00:04:37.670
Is this part of a dream as well?

00:04:37.670 --> 00:04:40.840
I don't know, either!

00:04:41.860 --> 00:04:44.680
Damn, they sure are fast.

00:04:44.680 --> 00:04:48.010
I never thought they'd run away this quickly.

00:04:48.010 --> 00:04:54.020
Please don't worry; we still have plans two and three on standby.

00:04:54.860 --> 00:05:00.320
Furude Rika, we won't let you challenge us, the Tokyo Magica, any more.

00:05:00.320 --> 00:05:02.580
Prepare yourself.

00:05:10.900 --> 00:05:13.340
What in the world was that?

00:05:13.340 --> 00:05:15.650
It is almost like something out of a monster movie.

00:05:15.650 --> 00:05:17.040
Satoko!

00:05:17.620 --> 00:05:19.420
Good morning!

00:05:19.830 --> 00:05:22.010
You're as cute as always!

00:05:22.010 --> 00:05:24.650
Oh, Rika-chan is cute as well!

00:05:24.650 --> 00:05:27.220
Shii, why are you here?

00:05:27.220 --> 00:05:30.050
In this world, Shii-chan's school is...

00:05:30.500 --> 00:05:32.730
What do you mean, "this world"?

00:05:32.730 --> 00:05:34.810
Of course my school is here.

00:05:34.810 --> 00:05:37.190
Shii-chan, no fair!

00:05:37.190 --> 00:05:39.310
I want to take Satoko home too!

00:05:40.970 --> 00:05:43.670
Good morning Satoko and everyone!

00:05:43.670 --> 00:05:45.580
Ah, Nii-nii!

00:05:45.580 --> 00:05:47.760
Teasin' Satoko already?

00:05:47.760 --> 00:05:49.320
Y'all never get tired of it, do you?

00:05:49.910 --> 00:05:54.080
Of course, Satoshi-kun and Satoko are both important to me.

00:05:54.080 --> 00:05:55.520
Nii-nii.

00:05:56.540 --> 00:05:57.580
Nii-nii!

00:05:59.510 --> 00:06:03.320
Let go of me, my Nii-nii has come back!

00:06:03.320 --> 00:06:05.210
Calm down, Satoko.

00:06:06.190 --> 00:06:09.970
That's probably not the Satoshi you know.

00:06:18.200 --> 00:06:20.230
Chie-sensei is late, isn't she?

00:06:20.840 --> 00:06:24.580
That's true; I'll go look for her.

00:06:24.580 --> 00:06:25.830
I'll go with you.

00:06:25.830 --> 00:06:28.950
She might be lost 'cuz of the fog.

00:06:28.950 --> 00:06:30.360
Thanks, Keiichi.

00:06:31.080 --> 00:06:33.120
No problem, Satoshi.

00:06:34.070 --> 00:06:36.670
Satoshi and Keiichi are really friendly.

00:06:36.670 --> 00:06:38.620
That's refreshing.

00:06:38.620 --> 00:06:44.130
Nii-nii and I are staying at a friend's house due to family issues.

00:06:44.760 --> 00:06:48.910
I am at your house and Nii-nii is at Keiichi-san's.

00:06:48.910 --> 00:06:53.890
No one remembers the Hinamizawa Syndrome or the battle with Tokyo.

00:06:53.890 --> 00:06:58.390
But then again, it doesn't look like we've gone back in time either.

00:06:58.390 --> 00:07:03.490
We've probably strayed into a parallel world.

00:07:03.490 --> 00:07:04.900
A parallel world?

00:07:05.300 --> 00:07:08.000
Rika, how can you remain so calm?

00:07:08.000 --> 00:07:10.780
I am about to lose my mind.

00:07:10.780 --> 00:07:13.870
Mii, I've gotten used to it.

00:07:13.870 --> 00:07:18.350
I'm not worried about getting into one or two parallel worlds.

00:07:18.350 --> 00:07:20.160
Nipah~

00:07:21.250 --> 00:07:25.610
Although, I am worried about that monster from earlier.

00:07:25.610 --> 00:07:29.170
Hanyu hasn't appeared yet, either. What's going on?

00:07:30.240 --> 00:07:32.050
Help!

00:07:32.460 --> 00:07:33.980
They're here!

00:07:33.980 --> 00:07:36.490
The Tokyo Magica Saigu Majin.

00:07:36.490 --> 00:07:38.180
They got Satoshi.

00:07:38.780 --> 00:07:39.930
My Nii-nii?

00:07:41.600 --> 00:07:44.080
The Tokyo Magica?

00:07:48.560 --> 00:07:50.570
Nii-nii! Nii-nii!

00:07:50.570 --> 00:07:51.700
Satoshi-kun!

00:07:52.730 --> 00:07:56.700
Don't worry, he's not hurt as badly as it looks.

00:07:57.090 --> 00:08:00.420
The monsters came out of the fog.

00:08:00.420 --> 00:08:03.640
We didn't have time to run, and Satoshi...

00:08:03.640 --> 00:08:04.710
Monsters?

00:08:05.210 --> 00:08:07.210
So it's <i>them</i> again!

00:08:07.210 --> 00:08:09.010
There's no question about it.

00:08:09.010 --> 00:08:13.480
The Tokyo Magica are using Saigu Majin to attack people.

00:08:13.480 --> 00:08:15.270
Wait a minute!

00:08:15.270 --> 00:08:17.790
Just what are the Tokyo Magica?

00:08:17.790 --> 00:08:19.350
What are you saying, Rika?

00:08:19.800 --> 00:08:21.530
Are you half asleep?

00:08:21.530 --> 00:08:23.890
The people who did this to Satoshi-kun...

00:08:23.890 --> 00:08:27.480
...are the secret, evil, magic-wielding society, the Tokyo Magica!

00:08:36.740 --> 00:08:38.120
Hanyu!

00:08:38.590 --> 00:08:44.620
And you, Rika, are the magical girl who fights them ~hanyu!

00:08:45.570 --> 00:08:52.130
I'm the advisor of the Magical Girl Oyashiro Rika, Hanyu ~hanyu!

00:08:54.740 --> 00:08:59.140
So you're the Rika and Satoko from a different world?

00:08:59.140 --> 00:09:05.150
I realised immediately, because I am the god of Furude shrine ~hanyu!

00:09:07.490 --> 00:09:13.150
So our two friends replaced you in your world?

00:09:13.540 --> 00:09:16.970
Is this something that the Tokyo Magica did as well?

00:09:16.970 --> 00:09:18.820
I don't think so.

00:09:18.820 --> 00:09:23.140
Even if it is the Tokyo Magica, they shouldn't have this sort of power ~hanyu.

00:09:23.140 --> 00:09:27.980
Mii, please tell me everything about the Tokyo Magica.

00:09:27.980 --> 00:09:31.170
And they are the ones who hurt my Nii-nii, correct?

00:09:31.170 --> 00:09:35.710
Yes, I'll explain everything from the beginning ~hanyu.

00:09:37.170 --> 00:09:40.380
Rika used to be the priestess of Furude Shrine.

00:09:41.150 --> 00:09:46.590
Inside the Saiguden of the shrine, there were many old instruments of torture ~hanyu.

00:09:46.590 --> 00:09:49.690
That's the same in our world.

00:09:50.310 --> 00:09:55.530
Every year, the grudges attached to the items within grew stronger,

00:09:55.530 --> 00:09:57.930
evolving into an enormous source of power.

00:09:57.930 --> 00:10:04.700
The secret, evil, magic-wielding society, the Tokyo Magica, came to steal this power ~hanyu.

00:10:06.100 --> 00:10:12.460
In order to stop them from taking the items, I gave Rika a magical wand ~hanyu.

00:10:14.350 --> 00:10:18.220
Even then, the little power we had wasn't enough to stop them...

00:10:22.860 --> 00:10:27.440
The instruments of torture scattered, became monsters known as Saigu Majin,

00:10:27.440 --> 00:10:29.980
and then began attacking everything in sight ~hanyu!

00:10:30.660 --> 00:10:35.980
The Tokyo Magica are trying to use the Saigu Majin to make arcane weapons ~hanyu.

00:10:36.790 --> 00:10:41.410
Their final objective is to dye the world black with their magic...

00:10:41.410 --> 00:10:43.370
...and create a world of utter darkness!

00:10:43.370 --> 00:10:48.620
Thus, they began using Hinamizawa as a testing ground for their weapons,

00:10:48.620 --> 00:10:54.880
and they even set their sights on draining the last bit of magic from Furude Shrine ~hanyu!

00:10:57.480 --> 00:11:02.340
They've already infiltrated the government and police.

00:11:02.340 --> 00:11:07.460
The only one who can protect Hinamizawa now is Rika. Only you ~hanyu!

00:11:07.460 --> 00:11:12.150
The only ones who know that Rika's a magical girl are the people here right now.

00:11:12.150 --> 00:11:15.180
Our identity as a gaming club is but a mask.

00:11:15.180 --> 00:11:21.280
In truth, we band together against the Tokyo Magica as the Rika-chan Rooters!

00:11:21.700 --> 00:11:24.980
I act as the Director of the group.

00:11:24.980 --> 00:11:28.910
By the way, all the uniforms were designed by me.

00:11:29.870 --> 00:11:32.920
Of all the the places I could have gone...

00:11:33.620 --> 00:11:39.080
But it's slightly similar to the setting of our Hinamizawa.

00:11:39.080 --> 00:11:41.430
I will not forgive the Tokyo Magica!

00:11:41.910 --> 00:11:46.530
Even if it is a parallel world, they harmed my Nii-nii!

00:11:46.530 --> 00:11:47.810
What she says is right.

00:11:48.230 --> 00:11:50.420
We will avenge Satoshi, together.

00:11:51.720 --> 00:11:55.060
Rika, where is your magic wand ~hanyu?

00:11:59.820 --> 00:12:02.480
You guys didn't have to come, did you?

00:12:02.480 --> 00:12:07.750
That is not true! I can not bear to sit around doing nothing.

00:12:07.750 --> 00:12:13.670
Satoshi has the Director by him and we have to protect Satoko and Rika.

00:12:13.670 --> 00:12:18.840
But can the Rika from a different world change into a magical girl? Can she?

00:12:19.250 --> 00:12:23.880
At any rate, getting to the wand is our top priority for now ~hanyu.

00:12:24.610 --> 00:12:26.030
Curry...

00:12:26.030 --> 00:12:26.720
Hanyu?

00:12:27.770 --> 00:12:29.110
Curry...

00:12:30.290 --> 00:12:31.730
Curry...

00:12:32.870 --> 00:12:34.230
Curry...

00:12:35.040 --> 00:12:36.430
Curry...

00:12:37.450 --> 00:12:39.230
Curry...

00:12:39.830 --> 00:12:41.460
Curry...

00:12:41.460 --> 00:12:44.610
My home-made curry...

00:12:44.860 --> 00:12:46.620
Eat it now!

00:12:50.620 --> 00:12:54.020
Curry!

00:13:02.770 --> 00:13:04.380
Stop!

00:13:05.020 --> 00:13:09.510
Are you saying you can't eat my home made curry?

00:13:10.510 --> 00:13:11.600
Satoko!

00:13:11.600 --> 00:13:12.790
KK!

00:13:12.790 --> 00:13:15.520
Anyone! Is anyone here?!

00:13:19.900 --> 00:13:21.900
Curry!

00:13:24.410 --> 00:13:26.780
Stop it.

00:13:32.750 --> 00:13:34.440
Hanyuuu!

00:13:35.740 --> 00:13:38.210
Looks like we got away, somehow.

00:13:38.210 --> 00:13:41.920
Even Tomitake and Oryou are acting strange ~hanyu.

00:13:44.170 --> 00:13:45.420
Hanyu?

00:13:45.420 --> 00:13:46.680
Hanyu.

00:13:47.480 --> 00:13:50.370
You're my advisor, right?

00:13:50.370 --> 00:13:53.430
Can't you just locate where Satoko and the others are?

00:13:53.430 --> 00:13:59.100
That's impossible. Wait, Rika, you've changed.

00:13:59.100 --> 00:14:00.560
Hauuu~

00:14:00.560 --> 00:14:04.820
The me over there is always like this; is the Rika here different?

00:14:04.820 --> 00:14:09.680
The Rika I know is a good girl who's honest and sincere.

00:14:09.680 --> 00:14:13.950
She's been giving her best at being a magical girl as well.

00:14:14.440 --> 00:14:18.070
Oh dear, transforming magical girls.

00:14:18.070 --> 00:14:23.090
How did she cope with it all without questioning any of it?

00:14:23.480 --> 00:14:28.440
I'm probably subbing for her because she was such a weakling.

00:14:28.440 --> 00:14:30.590
Hauauaua~

00:14:30.590 --> 00:14:32.040
Rika!

00:14:33.150 --> 00:14:35.600
You guys are okay? That's good.

00:14:36.450 --> 00:14:38.600
What happened to Mii and Shii?

00:14:38.600 --> 00:14:40.270
Hauauau~

00:14:40.270 --> 00:14:42.610
She's so two-faced ~hanyu!

00:14:43.070 --> 00:14:48.430
We got separated while running away when the townsfolk attacked.

00:14:50.850 --> 00:14:55.910
This fog is probably designed to make people go crazy.

00:14:59.360 --> 00:15:05.340
In our world, although the plot's slightly different, we had something similar.

00:15:05.340 --> 00:15:10.510
Since Rika and Satoko are from a different world, I don't think the fog will affect you.

00:15:10.510 --> 00:15:12.510
But if we don't hurry...

00:15:19.800 --> 00:15:21.760
There are you are, Rika.

00:15:21.760 --> 00:15:23.490
We've been waiting for you.

00:15:24.810 --> 00:15:28.940
Satoko, I'm going to pet you a lot.

00:15:28.940 --> 00:15:31.830
You just wait for me.

00:15:34.880 --> 00:15:37.180
Rika-chan, Satoko-chan...

00:15:37.180 --> 00:15:39.910
I'll be taking you both home tonight!

00:15:40.710 --> 00:15:45.370
You don't know when to stop, Rika-chan, Satoko.

00:15:45.370 --> 00:15:48.880
I guess we'll have to punish you both.

00:15:48.880 --> 00:15:51.170
Properly, strictly.

00:15:52.590 --> 00:15:55.470
I'll burn away all the bad parts with gasoline.

00:15:56.040 --> 00:15:58.180
I'm sure it'll be pretty.

00:15:58.180 --> 00:16:01.150
Hauauau~

00:16:01.150 --> 00:16:03.940
This trio has a lot of punch.

00:16:03.940 --> 00:16:07.690
I have a sinking feeling that we can't win...

00:16:07.690 --> 00:16:08.690
Here they come!

00:16:20.200 --> 00:16:26.210
Go me! Even in this world, I had traps ready.

00:16:29.640 --> 00:16:31.970
We've found it ~hanyu!

00:16:40.240 --> 00:16:45.010
So the catch is that Rika can't transform without this, eh?

00:16:45.010 --> 00:16:46.230
Keiichi-san!

00:16:46.230 --> 00:16:48.950
It's been bothering me for a while now.

00:16:48.950 --> 00:16:51.990
The reason you were the only one who wasn't crazy from the fog.

00:16:52.770 --> 00:16:54.110
You've got a good nose there.

00:16:54.760 --> 00:17:00.300
That's 'cuz I was crazy from the start!

00:17:00.300 --> 00:17:04.500
Then... were you the one who hurt my Nii-nii?

00:17:04.500 --> 00:17:05.910
Yeah!

00:17:05.910 --> 00:17:09.040
I was just burning up, wanting to beat the pulp out of someone.

00:17:11.940 --> 00:17:17.390
Oh well, I guess the Keiichi in this world is just as careless as ours.

00:17:19.640 --> 00:17:21.640
Keiichi, sorry.

00:17:21.640 --> 00:17:22.910
Meen!

00:17:26.360 --> 00:17:27.750
Nii-nii!

00:17:27.750 --> 00:17:30.150
Satoko! Thank goodness I made it in time.

00:17:31.020 --> 00:17:33.150
Nii-nii!

00:17:33.150 --> 00:17:34.630
Satoko.

00:17:38.400 --> 00:17:42.540
Even if they are from different worlds, brothers and sisters remain the same.

00:17:45.050 --> 00:17:47.380
I'm not finished yet!

00:17:47.380 --> 00:17:48.030
Apparate!

00:17:48.030 --> 00:17:49.140
Saigu Majin!

00:17:49.140 --> 00:17:50.670
Nail Ripper!

00:17:54.320 --> 00:17:55.420
Do it!

00:18:10.060 --> 00:18:13.190
Thanks for earlier,

00:18:13.190 --> 00:18:15.990
but the real fun starts here!

00:18:16.420 --> 00:18:19.850
Satoshi-kun, I'll flay you entirely.

00:18:19.850 --> 00:18:21.830
Satoko-chan...

00:18:22.200 --> 00:18:26.200
I've designed a new costume, please wear it.

00:18:26.540 --> 00:18:30.460
My curry... it's really tasty.

00:18:30.940 --> 00:18:33.960
You gotta try my ohagi, too.

00:18:38.390 --> 00:18:41.970
Satoko, come play with your big brother.

00:18:42.470 --> 00:18:44.920
Nii-nii went crazy too!

00:18:44.920 --> 00:18:48.600
Since he had his mask off, the fog got to him as well.

00:18:52.110 --> 00:18:55.610
Rika, you've got to transform! There's no other way ~hanyu!

00:18:56.070 --> 00:18:57.930
If it is you Rika, you can definitely do it.

00:18:57.930 --> 00:19:02.630
Though it is in a different shape, we are fighting evil using mystical force.

00:19:02.630 --> 00:19:05.370
You were something like a magical girl from the beginning.

00:19:07.030 --> 00:19:08.570
Rika!

00:19:08.570 --> 00:19:10.180
Rika.

00:19:10.180 --> 00:19:13.130
Oh well, I suppose there's no choice.

00:19:14.040 --> 00:19:15.070
Shine!

00:19:15.070 --> 00:19:16.950
Oyashiro Nipah Nipower!

00:19:16.950 --> 00:19:20.470
Crystal Make Up!

00:19:29.230 --> 00:19:33.150
Magical Girl Oyashiro Rika!

00:19:33.900 --> 00:19:36.740
She's really enjoying herself ~hanyu...

00:19:36.740 --> 00:19:40.150
Perhaps she actually enjoys this sort of thing?

00:19:42.390 --> 00:19:43.390
Huh?

00:19:43.390 --> 00:19:46.490
Hey! Why am I still a kid?

00:19:46.490 --> 00:19:49.240
Argh! Why? Why?

00:19:47.630 --> 00:19:51.100
Apparently she thought she could become an adult by transforming ~hanyu.

00:19:51.100 --> 00:19:52.780
She has been a child for so long.

00:19:52.780 --> 00:19:55.750
You really wanted to know what you would look like as an adult.

00:19:55.750 --> 00:19:57.420
Poor thing.

00:19:57.420 --> 00:20:02.050
Argh, I'm going to blame the Tokyo Magica for this!

00:20:02.050 --> 00:20:06.010
To the people of Hinamizawa, entrapped by the heart of evil,

00:20:06.010 --> 00:20:09.680
I shall purify your hearts and set you on the road of righteousness!

00:20:20.320 --> 00:20:21.580
Nii-nii!

00:20:29.280 --> 00:20:33.030
Keiichi, you're all that's left.

00:20:33.030 --> 00:20:34.750
Charge, Nail Ripper!

00:20:34.750 --> 00:20:37.290
Make that little girl squeal!

00:20:46.050 --> 00:20:46.930
What?!

00:20:48.680 --> 00:20:52.350
Keiichi, return to your true self!

00:21:03.390 --> 00:21:06.070
Keiichi's face has gone back to normal!

00:21:07.660 --> 00:21:12.220
If only the world we were from were this easy.

00:21:13.430 --> 00:21:16.330
I expected this much from the "Queen of Hinamizawa".

00:21:19.060 --> 00:21:20.150
Takano!

00:21:20.150 --> 00:21:23.290
Even in this world, you are still the puppet master.

00:21:23.290 --> 00:21:25.260
As one of the Shiten-nou of the Tokyo Magica,

00:21:25.260 --> 00:21:28.850
I, Takano Mio, shall be your opponent!

00:21:53.350 --> 00:21:56.120
So what will you do now?

00:21:58.200 --> 00:21:59.130
Rika!

00:21:59.420 --> 00:22:01.710
Satoko, don't follow me!

00:22:02.630 --> 00:22:06.630
If I fight there, Keiichi and the others will get trampled underfoot.

00:22:06.630 --> 00:22:08.800
I need to change the battleground!

00:22:19.400 --> 00:22:22.570
Takano, you too will regain your righteous heart!

00:22:27.360 --> 00:22:30.180
Please, an attack like that is useless.

00:22:30.180 --> 00:22:37.160
I have the grandiose goal of proving the magical theory my grandfather left me.

00:22:45.750 --> 00:22:46.520
Rika!

00:22:46.520 --> 00:22:47.950
She isn't called a Shiten-nou for nothing.

00:22:47.950 --> 00:22:50.680
If this keeps up, Rika's in deep trouble ~hanyu!

00:22:57.150 --> 00:22:58.430
Satoko!

00:23:02.130 --> 00:23:02.940
Rika!

00:23:04.240 --> 00:23:07.820
Satoko, you shouldn't have come here.

00:23:07.820 --> 00:23:11.200
From today onward, I shall be the "Queen of Hinamizawa"!

00:23:14.080 --> 00:23:15.450
Satoko!

00:23:15.450 --> 00:23:18.040
I will not let you kill Rika!

00:23:18.040 --> 00:23:20.200
It's no use, Satoko.

00:23:20.200 --> 00:23:21.460
Just run, quickly!

00:23:22.330 --> 00:23:27.960
Rika has gone through many hardships for our sake.

00:23:28.560 --> 00:23:31.970
This time it is my turn to protect you.

00:23:32.800 --> 00:23:34.220
Satoko...

00:23:35.150 --> 00:23:39.310
Then I suppose I'll just have to take care of both of you!

00:23:39.310 --> 00:23:41.580
If I only had more power...

00:23:42.390 --> 00:23:45.480
...the power to protect Rika and Nii-nii.

00:23:49.350 --> 00:23:52.050
Oyashiro-sama, I beg of you, please give me strength.

00:23:52.050 --> 00:23:55.240
The strength to protect Rika and everyone.

00:23:55.240 --> 00:23:57.990
I've been waiting for those words ~hanyu!

00:24:01.750 --> 00:24:06.500
Satoko, that prayer will now become a great power ~hanyu!

00:24:20.040 --> 00:24:21.270
What's this?

00:24:21.270 --> 00:24:23.650
Satoko, transform.

00:24:24.470 --> 00:24:25.720
I am going to transform?

00:24:25.720 --> 00:24:27.520
Hurry up and do it already!

00:24:27.520 --> 00:24:29.690
I understand!

00:24:30.280 --> 00:24:33.030
Shine Sparkle Courageous Light!

00:24:31.950 --> 00:24:33.180
Echo!

00:24:33.030 --> 00:24:35.950
Forward, toward a magical star!

00:24:33.180 --> 00:24:34.700
Oyashiro Nipah Nipower!

00:24:34.700 --> 00:24:37.160
Crystal Make Up!

00:24:35.950 --> 00:24:37.330
Go go miracle go!

00:24:37.330 --> 00:24:38.790
Everybody's here to celebrate!

00:24:38.790 --> 00:24:39.950
Go go try hard!

00:24:39.950 --> 00:24:41.330
We're still growing bigger!

00:24:41.330 --> 00:24:42.780
Won- Won- Wonderful!

00:24:42.780 --> 00:24:44.130
Everybody's here to celebrate!

00:24:44.130 --> 00:24:45.570
So we will never ever...

00:24:44.500 --> 00:24:47.840
Magical Trap Girl Satoko!

00:24:45.570 --> 00:24:47.240
...100% give up!

00:24:47.240 --> 00:24:49.920
Anyone's SOS...

00:24:47.840 --> 00:24:49.760
Satoko!

00:24:49.920 --> 00:24:51.900
...we'll catch it!

00:24:51.900 --> 00:24:53.630
Fly up high! (Fly up high!)

00:24:53.630 --> 00:24:55.200
I've got to go...

00:24:54.590 --> 00:24:56.710
Rika-chan! Satoko!

00:24:55.200 --> 00:24:57.600
...to my important show!

00:24:58.220 --> 00:25:00.830
Giving my all,

00:24:58.480 --> 00:24:59.720
Guys!

00:25:00.770 --> 00:25:02.980
They've returned to normal ~hanyu!

00:25:00.830 --> 00:25:02.980
it's my little secret!

00:25:02.980 --> 00:25:04.470
Everybody (Everybody),

00:25:04.470 --> 00:25:06.100
today (today),

00:25:05.030 --> 00:25:06.600
What happened to you?

00:25:06.100 --> 00:25:08.950
let's get together and stick forever.

00:25:07.120 --> 00:25:09.560
My little sister is a magical girl too?!

00:25:08.950 --> 00:25:11.420
I panic when under stress,

00:25:09.560 --> 00:25:11.630
She doesn't need a reason.

00:25:11.420 --> 00:25:14.200
but girls can't be put down like that!

00:25:12.090 --> 00:25:13.110
It suits you!

00:25:14.200 --> 00:25:17.000
Jubilee everyone!

00:25:14.600 --> 00:25:16.740
I wanna take her home!

00:25:17.000 --> 00:25:20.410
The heroine's day is always busy.

00:25:20.410 --> 00:25:21.620
Lets go!

00:25:20.430 --> 00:25:23.010
Rika, it is time for our counter-attack!

00:25:21.620 --> 00:25:23.720
Like a lion!

00:25:23.010 --> 00:25:24.870
OK, Satoko!

00:25:23.720 --> 00:25:25.900
We aren't afraid of anything, oh no.

00:25:24.870 --> 00:25:28.250
Don't hold back, Nail Ripper!

00:25:25.900 --> 00:25:27.340
Shout out!

00:25:27.340 --> 00:25:29.380
Triple your goal!

00:25:29.380 --> 00:25:32.190
We'll make them come true!

00:25:32.190 --> 00:25:34.720
Don't give up...

00:25:34.720 --> 00:25:36.870
...and we'll show you...

00:25:36.870 --> 00:25:40.080
...all you bad guys are gonna get it!

00:25:40.080 --> 00:25:42.970
Shine Sparkle Courageous Light!

00:25:41.870 --> 00:25:42.970
A trap?

00:25:42.970 --> 00:25:45.520
Forward, toward a magical star!

00:25:45.440 --> 00:25:48.480
Seventh Explosion!

00:25:45.520 --> 00:25:47.310
Go go miracle go!

00:25:47.310 --> 00:25:49.940
Everybody's here to celebrate!

00:25:49.940 --> 00:25:51.350
We're still growing bigger!

00:25:51.350 --> 00:25:52.620
Won- Won- Wonderful!

00:25:52.620 --> 00:25:53.860
Everybody's here to celebrate!

00:25:53.860 --> 00:25:55.460
So we will never ever...

00:25:54.360 --> 00:25:58.470
I'm sorry, Grandpa...

00:25:55.460 --> 00:25:57.540
...100% give up!

00:26:06.790 --> 00:26:11.560
Takano Miyo, you flapped your gums quite a bit, but look at you now.

00:26:11.560 --> 00:26:13.760
A stain on the title of Shiten-nou.

00:26:14.530 --> 00:26:18.270
Well, she was the weakest of us all.

00:26:18.270 --> 00:26:21.510
I shall deploy the "Wild Dogs" next.

00:26:21.510 --> 00:26:24.660
Nah, it's mah turn next.

00:26:24.660 --> 00:26:28.430
Satoko don't know that I'm Shiten-nou yet.

00:26:30.490 --> 00:26:35.280
I'll teach them kids a lesson. I'll strip 'em stark naked and sink 'em into a boiling bubble bath!

00:26:35.980 --> 00:26:36.780
All for...!

00:26:36.780 --> 00:26:39.610
All for the Tokyo Magica!

00:26:39.610 --> 00:26:42.780
Making us three minds and powers one,

00:26:42.780 --> 00:26:46.290
we shall one day overthrow Furude Rika!

00:26:59.400 --> 00:27:05.070
It looks like we've been entrusted with the responsibility of protecting Hinamizawa.

00:27:05.070 --> 00:27:06.850
So it seems.

00:27:06.850 --> 00:27:10.590
Even if this is a parallel world, Hinamizawa is Hinamizawa.

00:27:10.590 --> 00:27:13.900
Let us do what we can to help it.

00:27:13.900 --> 00:27:16.820
'Course we'll be supportin' you guys all the way.

00:27:16.820 --> 00:27:21.280
Today we got in the way, but next time we'll be there to help!

00:27:22.060 --> 00:27:24.950
To be honest, I'm worried...

00:27:24.950 --> 00:27:27.320
Even Satoko turned into a magical girl.

00:27:27.320 --> 00:27:29.020
She'll be fine!

00:27:29.020 --> 00:27:31.150
No matter how strong the enemy is...

00:27:31.150 --> 00:27:32.350
...She'll win!

00:27:32.350 --> 00:27:35.040
And she'll protect Hinamizawa, no matter what!

00:27:35.040 --> 00:27:37.050
That's right!

00:27:37.050 --> 00:27:41.390
The peace of Hinamizawa is in all of your hands!

00:27:41.390 --> 00:27:42.300
Hanyu!

00:27:42.950 --> 00:27:45.860
Let us do our best, Rika!

00:27:45.860 --> 00:27:47.810
Yes, Satoko.

00:27:54.290 --> 00:27:57.690
Is this really going to work out?

00:28:05.470 --> 00:28:09.910
The person who lost is 'It'. You're going to get caught! (This way or that?)

00:28:09.910 --> 00:28:15.060
A heart-racing dream that I just can't awaken from. Longer than eternity.

00:28:23.150 --> 00:28:27.920
One man's trash is another man's treasure.

00:28:27.920 --> 00:28:32.080
So when everything seems lost, I'll call out to Satoko.

00:28:32.080 --> 00:28:34.410
I just can't wait until it's time to go home.

00:28:34.410 --> 00:28:36.900
I wonder what kind of game we'll play today?

00:28:36.900 --> 00:28:42.520
Even if we'll just be messing about, it's time for a special transformation!

00:28:42.520 --> 00:28:47.100
The person who lost is 'It'. You're going to get caught! (This way or that?)

00:28:47.100 --> 00:28:51.280
A heart-racing dream that I just can't awaken from. Longer than eternity.

00:28:51.280 --> 00:28:56.630
The key is a heart that believes.

00:28:57.990 --> 00:29:02.540
Innocently, we'll face troubles never seen before,

00:29:02.540 --> 00:29:04.900
if we combine our powers.

00:29:04.900 --> 00:29:07.000
So let's head on, working miracles!

00:29:07.000 --> 00:29:11.460
Even if there's trouble ahead, and tomorrow seems a little bizarre,

00:29:11.460 --> 00:29:13.910
the diversions we take today...

00:29:13.910 --> 00:29:16.250
...will make us shine more than anyone. (Yes!)

00:29:16.250 --> 00:29:18.390
Our chance! (A-hahahaha!)

00:29:18.390 --> 00:29:20.620
Our dream! (Nipah~)

00:29:20.620 --> 00:29:26.510
A time begins where we have surpassed ourselves.
